        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>At 10% capacity, the call list catches fewer readmissions among patients 80+ than in any other age group. The under-40 group is small, so its rate is less reliable.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
